  "question": {
    "text": "In a class tournament where the participants were to play one game with one another, two of the class players fell ill, having played <math><mn>3</mn></math> games each. If the total number of games played is <math><mn>27</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the number of participants at the beginning was",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Suppose, the two players did not play at all such that the remaining <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> players played <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> matches.<br />Since, these two players played <math><mn>3</mn></math> matches each, hence the total number of matches is <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo></math>",
